# Allow the bundled native app (origin capacitor://localhost) to cross-origin
# fetch static front-end assets here — most importantly the SVG icon sprite
# (assets/icons/merged.svg). Without an Access-Control-Allow-Origin header the
# WKWebView blocks that fetch, so every mat-icon (navbar buttons, share/rate
# icons) renders blank.
#
# These are public static files served directly by the web server (LiteSpeed),
# which bypasses Laravel — so config/cors.php can't add the header; it must be
# set here. Token-auth only (no cookies), so a wildcard origin is safe.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header set Access-Control-Allow-Origin "*"
    Header set Access-Control-Allow-Methods "GET, OPTIONS"
</IfModule>
